*& Form POPULATE_HEADER_STRUCTURE - CORRECTED VERSION
*& Based on FDS Table 4.1.7 - ZTB_A2R_WBSHDR Table Structure
*&———————————————————————*
FORM populate_header_structure.

CLEAR gs_header.

“ FDS Table 4.1.7 - Field Mapping
“ Note: MANDT is handled automatically by SAP

“ Primary Key: ZREQ_NUM (will be generated during save)

“ IM Data (from Screen 1)
gs_header-posnr = p_posnr.              “ IM Program Position (IMPR-POSNR)
gs_header-prnam = p_prnam.              “ IM Program (IMPR-PRNAM)

“ Project Data (will be populated after project creation)
“ gs_header-pspnr = …                 “ Project ID (PROJ-PSPNR) - set after creation

“ FDS Table 4.1.5: POST1 is Description, NOT PSPNR!
gs_header-post1 = p_post1.              “ Project Description (USER INPUT)

“ Responsible Person
gs_header-vernr = p_verna.              “ Person Responsible (PROJ-VERNR)

“ Dates
gs_header-plsez = p_plsez.              “ Finish Date (PROJ-PLSEZ)
gs_header-erdat = sy-datum.             “ Request Created On (SYSTEM)

“ Organizational Data
gs_header-bukrs = gv_bukrs.             “ Company Code (IMPR-BUKRS)
gs_header-werks = gv_werks.             “ Plant (IMPR-WERKS)

“ Financial Data
gs_header-prctr = p_prctr.              “ Profit Center (IMPR-PRCTR)
gs_header-kostl = p_kostl.              “ Cost Center (IMPR-KOSTL)

“ Investment Data
gs_header-izwek = gv_izwek.             “ Investment Reason (IMPR-IZWEK)
gs_header-profl = p_profl.              “ Project Profile (ZTB_A2R_CONFTAB1)

“ Flags and Special Fields
gs_header-zunifier_proj = p_usr10.      “ GE Ariba WF Flag (IMPR-USR10)
gs_header-usr008 = gv_usr008.           “ CAR Approval Date (IMPR-USR008)

“ User and Type Information
gs_header-ernam = sy-uname.             “ Requestor (SYSTEM)
gs_header-z_reqtype = gv_request_type.  “ Request Type (from Screen 0)

“ FDS Section 4.1.3: Status Handling
“ Status will be set during save/submit:
“ - ‘DRAFT’ when Save button is clicked
“ - ‘PENDING’ when Submit button is clicked
“ - ‘APPROVED’ when workflow approves
“ - ‘REJECTED’ when workflow rejects
“ gs_header-request_status = … (set in SAVE_REQUEST or SUBMIT_REQUEST)

“ Optional: Remarks field (if it exists in your table)
IF gv_z_remarks IS NOT INITIAL.
gs_header-z_remarks = gv_z_remarks.   “ User remarks/notes
ENDIF.

“ Fields that will be populated AFTER approval:
“ gs_header-zrequest_approved_on = …  “ Request Approved On (set after approval)
“ gs_header-zapproved_by = …          “ Approved By (set after approval)

ENDFORM.

